cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MA-PMO in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "MA-PMO: Multi-Agent Project Management Office"
abstract: >-
  An LLM-backed supervisor-worker multi-agent system (A1–A7) for portfolio and
  project management, with an evaluation harness for hypotheses H1–H5 across
  five efficiency axes (time, resource, delivery, risk, cost).
type: software
authors:
